## VERIFIED TAILWIND SETUP

astro.config.mjs uses:

import tailwindcss from '@tailwindcss/vite';

src/styles/global.css contains:

@import "tailwindcss";

This is Tailwind CSS 4.

Do NOT replace it with legacy Tailwind 3 configuration.
Do NOT add @astrojs/tailwind.


