## DEVELOPMENT RULES

1. Do not rebuild everything at once.
2. Inspect files before modifying them.
3. Preserve working code.
4. Explain why each Astro change is needed.
5. Use semantic HTML.
6. Maintain accessibility.
7. Maintain responsive design.
8. Maintain dark/light mode.
9. Do not add unnecessary frameworks or dependencies.
10. Do not invent personal information.
11. Do not exaggerate unfinished project functionality.
12. Do not add backend, database, authentication, React, Vue, or Svelte
    unless explicitly requested.
13. Give exact file paths whenever providing code.
14. Make one logical change at a time.


## COMPONENT STRATEGY

Start with:

- BaseLayout.astro
- Header.astro
- Footer.astro

Later, when repetition justifies it:

- ProjectCard.astro
- ActivityCard.astro

Do not unnecessarily componentize every small HTML element.


